{
  "info": {
    "name": "AISafe - Airports (distributed)",
    "description": "Testes da componente Airports com 3 réplicas (SIDIS Assignment 1).\nPré-requisito: a partir de code/, `./scripts/start-replicas.sh airports demo` (ou `.\\scripts\\start-replicas.ps1 -Service airports -Profiles demo`).\nA pasta 6 (US210) precisa também do Flight Routes com o perfil demo.\nUsar o environment Airports.postman_environment.json e correr as pastas por ordem.\nAntes da pasta 7, PARAR a réplica 2 (porta 8183).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup — health e tokens",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health ap1",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{ap1}}/actuator/health"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"UP\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"UP\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"peers component present\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().components).to.have.property(\"peers\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Health ap2",
